      "en": "## Install\n\n```bash\n# with npm\nnpm install @gorgo/medusa-fulfillment-apiship@beta\n# or with yarn\nyarn add @gorgo/medusa-fulfillment-apiship@beta\n# or with pnpm\npnpm add @gorgo/medusa-fulfillment-apiship@beta\n```\n\n## Use\n\nAdd the following to your Medusa configuration:\n\n```medusa-config.ts\nconst APISHIP_INTEGRATION_ID = \"apiship-1\"\n\nmodule.exports = defineConfig({\n  plugins: [\n    {\n      resolve: \"@gorgo/medusa-integration\",\n      options: {\n        encryptionKey: process.env.INTEGRATION_ENCRYPTION_KEY,\n        providers: [\n          {\n            resolve: \"@gorgo/medusa-fulfillment-apiship/providers/integration-apiship\",\n            id: APISHIP_INTEGRATION_ID,\n            options: {},\n          },\n        ],\n      },\n    },\n    {\n      resolve: \"@gorgo/medusa-fulfillment-apiship\",\n      options: {},\n    },\n  ],\n  modules: [\n    {\n      resolve: \"@medusajs/medusa/fulfillment\",\n      options: {\n        providers: [\n          {\n            resolve: \"@gorgo/medusa-fulfillment-apiship/providers/fulfillment-apiship\",\n            id: \"apiship\",\n            options: { id: APISHIP_INTEGRATION_ID },\n          },\n        ],\n      },\n    },\n  ],\n})\n```\n\nThen restart the server.\n\n## Set up\n\n1. Open **Settings → Integrations → ApiShip**.\n2. Configure integration settings.\n",
      "ru": "## Установка\n\n```bash\n# with npm\nnpm install @gorgo/medusa-fulfillment-apiship@beta\n# or with yarn\nyarn add @gorgo/medusa-fulfillment-apiship@beta\n# or with pnpm\npnpm add @gorgo/medusa-fulfillment-apiship@beta\n```\n\n## Подключение\n\nДобавьте следующий код в конфигурацию Medusa:\n\n```medusa-config.ts\nconst APISHIP_INTEGRATION_ID = \"apiship-1\"\n\nmodule.exports = defineConfig({\n  plugins: [\n    {\n      resolve: \"@gorgo/medusa-integration\",\n      options: {\n        encryptionKey: process.env.INTEGRATION_ENCRYPTION_KEY,\n        providers: [\n          {\n            resolve: \"@gorgo/medusa-fulfillment-apiship/providers/integration-apiship\",\n            id: APISHIP_INTEGRATION_ID,\n            options: {},\n          },\n        ],\n      },\n    },\n    {\n      resolve: \"@gorgo/medusa-fulfillment-apiship\",\n      options: {},\n    },\n  ],\n  modules: [\n    {\n      resolve: \"@medusajs/medusa/fulfillment\",\n      options: {\n        providers: [\n          {\n            resolve: \"@gorgo/medusa-fulfillment-apiship/providers/fulfillment-apiship\",\n            id: \"apiship\",\n            options: { id: APISHIP_INTEGRATION_ID },\n          },\n        ],\n      },\n    },\n  ],\n})\n```\n\nЗатем перезапустите сервер.\n\n## Настройка\n\n1. Откройте **Настройки → Интеграции → ApiShip**.\n2. Настройте параметры интеграции.\n"
