      "ru": "## Установка\n\n```bash\n# with npm\nnpm install @gorgo/medusa-payment-yookassa@beta\n# or with yarn\nyarn add @gorgo/medusa-payment-yookassa@beta\n# or with pnpm\npnpm add @gorgo/medusa-payment-yookassa@beta\n```\n\n## Подключение\n\nДобавьте следующий код в конфигурацию Medusa:\n\n```medusa-config.ts\nconst YOOKASSA_INTEGRATION_ID = \"yookassa-1\"\n\nmodule.exports = defineConfig({\n  plugins: [\n    {\n      resolve: \"@gorgo/medusa-integration\",\n      options: {\n        encryptionKey: process.env.INTEGRATION_ENCRYPTION_KEY,\n        providers: [\n          {\n            resolve: \"@gorgo/medusa-payment-yookassa/providers/integration-yookassa\",\n            id: YOOKASSA_INTEGRATION_ID,\n            options: {},\n          },\n        ],\n      },\n    },\n    {\n      resolve: \"@gorgo/medusa-payment-yookassa\",\n      options: {},\n    },\n  ],\n  modules: [\n    {\n      resolve: \"@medusajs/medusa/payment\",\n      options: {\n        providers: [\n          {\n            resolve: \"@gorgo/medusa-payment-yookassa/providers/payment-yookassa\",\n            id: \"yookassa\",\n            options: { id: YOOKASSA_INTEGRATION_ID },\n          },\n        ],\n      },\n    },\n  ],\n})\n```\n\nЗатем перезапустите сервер.\n\n## Настройка\n\n1. Откройте **Настройки → Интеграции → ЮKassa**.\n2. Настройте параметры интеграции.\n"
